<title>UK: TENNIS SPOTLIGHT-STATISTICS OF BECKER V GORRIZ.</title>
<headline>TENNIS SPOTLIGHT-STATISTICS OF BECKER V GORRIZ.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Statistics of a first round match</p>
<p>between eighth seed Boris Becker of Germany and Marcos Aurelio</p>
<p>Gorriz of Spain at Wimbledon on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Becker won 6-3 6-2 6-3</p>
<p>Time: one hour and 42 minutes</p>
<p>		     BECKER    GORRIZ</p>
<p>Aces		   12	  4 </p>
<p>Double faults	 8	  5</p>
<p>Percentage first </p>
<p>serves		 48	 56</p>
<p>Unreturned serves  38	 22</p>
<p>Forehand winners    8	  2</p>
<p>Backhand winners    8	  4</p>
<p>Volley winners     14	  5</p>
<p>Break points won    5	  0</p>
</text>
